								text: "<p>Thou didst shine forth in the splendor of thy deeds, * and becamest an heir to the throne of the apostles, O venerable Nicetas; * and, wholly filled with divine doctrines, O father, * thou didst shine forth like the sun upon the flock. ** Wherefore, we cry to thee: Rejoice, O adornment of Chalcedon!</p>",
