								text: "<p>In his suffering, O Lord, * Thy martyr Hermias received an imperishable crown from Thee our God; * for, possessed of Thy might, * he set at nought the tormentors and crushed the feeble audacity of the demons. ** By his supplications save Thou our souls.</p>",
